type: software
title: "The Playground (Superframe)"
abstract: "The Playground (Superframe v0.4.0) is a deterministic creative, rendering, optics, audio DSP, and 6-DOF physical-AI engine with 39/39 bit-exact 0-ULP C++23 to BuildLang renderer parity modules. From one seeded recipe it renders paint, living type, line drawing, materials, sound, touch, DX12/Vulkan/WebGPU worlds, ITU-R BT.2020/2100 spectral optics, clean-room taste synths, and plain-language and JSON studies."
